	"data": "Hardware: Elements Drive\n\nWhat It Is\nWD 7.3TB external hard drive, NTFS, ~66% used. Connected to star at /run/media/cithoreal/Elements. The primary audio journal archive.\n\nTop-Level Structure\nMemoryBase/ — main personal archive (audio journals, transcripts, Obsidian vaults, video, IPFS)\nVideos/ — game recordings, dev logs\nUnity Projects/, UnityAssetsRepo/ — old game dev work\nBackup/, Syncthing/, go-btfs/ — infrastructure/backup\nAir Hockey Documented/ — Unity game project docs\n\nAudio Journal…",
